  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder (config_005: 0.650 accuracy) outperform multimodal baselines. However, multimodal approaches with better image encoders (e.g., imagenet_vit_l) may offer gains. This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 RNA with imagenet_vit_l image encoder (a stronger image encoder than resnet50) using avgpool and concat fusion, which directly addresses the uncertainty about whether superior image encoders can surpass RNA-only performance. It isolates the effect of image encoder quality while leveraging the best RNA encoder, balancing exploration and exploitation."
}

